  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of integrated, quality life-saving sexual and reproductive health and gender-based violence response and prevention among the most vulnerable population in North Kordofan, South Kordofan, North Darfur, East Darfur, South Darfur and West Darfur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, UNFPA is scaling up its efforts by enhancing the provision of services through both integration and localization strategies in affected communities, healthcare facilities, and through the deployment of temporary/mobile clinics. The project also addresses the immediate needs of women and girls through cash assistance for SRH/GBV. UNFPA is targeting a combined total of 81,265 affected people with Health (SRH) and Protection (GBV) activities.</narrative>
  </description>
